%% Gateway Guardian - 通知流程
flowchart TB
    A[🔔 通知类型] --> B[🚀 启动通知]
    A --> C[⚠️ 故障告警]
    A --> D[🔧 修复中]
    A --> E[✅ 恢复成功]
    A --> F[🔙 回滚通知]
    A --> G[❌ 恢复失败]
    
    B --> H[Discord Webhook]
    C --> H
    D --> H
    E --> H
    F --> H
    G --> H
    
    H --> I{发送成功?}
    I -->|✅| J[✅ 通知已送达]
    I -->|❌| K[⚠️ 通知失败<br/>记录日志]
    
    style B fill:#E8F5E9,stroke:#388E3C
    style C fill:#FFF3E0,stroke:#F57C00
    style E fill:#90EE90,stroke:#2E7D32
    style G fill:#FFCDD2,stroke:#C62828
